{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girls \u00d7 Fantasy \u00d7 Mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie Game &quot;Dreamy Golden Snow&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/2ab4be17c89d1d7bb22aabadab3710e0.avif?t=1767466406\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Introduction]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy mystery visual novel that tells a story among high school girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s ordinary, just like countless other schools that educate students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until an unexpected death occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/07f04b05368a75722a19126dfab2c5f5.avif?t=1767466406\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Story]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bai Yi wakes up in darkness and realizes three things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, she doesn\u2019t recognize this place\u2014she has no idea where she is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second, she seems to have lost \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third, she is being haunted by \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/cf5168d13a2388165182b271bba15067.avif?t=1767466406\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tightly woven story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 4 - 6 hrs game time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 story illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive clue investigation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich character gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/54ad028722a6ad9e7882cc31addcdbd1.avif?t=1767466406\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Disclaimer]</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Any resemblance to actual events, locations, or persons, living or dead, is purely coincidental.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is classified as a suspense-driven experience rather than a logic-based deduction game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Player choices are unrestricted, and there are no penalties for any selection.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains sensitive content, including depictions of murder, suicide, and self-harm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Viewer discretion is advised. Please discontinue play if you feel uncomfortable.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain scenes and events are intentionally dramatized for storytelling purposes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They are not intended to reflect real-life situations and should not be imitated.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes negative portrayals of certain professions for storytelling purposes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These opinions are fictional and do not represent the views of the developer.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some characters may express opinions or viewpoints that could be considered disturbing or offensive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These opinions are fictional and do not represent the views of the developer.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains minor lesbian themes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These elements are present but are not a central focus of the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863840?t=1767466406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/f8566974ed58eeb068130152f72be06f9775020e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767466406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/f8716da4c929e3f14d07bedab8a48560f2a102ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767466406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/f8716da4c929e3f14d07bedab8a48560f2a102ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767466406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girls \u00d7 Fantasy \u00d7 Mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie Game &quot;Dreamy Golden Snow&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863840/extras/2ab4be17c89d1d7bb22aabadab3710e0.avif?t=1767466406\" width=600 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Introduction]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy mystery visual novel that tells a story among high school girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s ordinary, just like countless other schools that educate students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until an unexpected death occurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla